   "id": "hdr_sticky",
   "name": "HEADER",
   "parameters": {
    "content": "# NZAMY · Billing & Wallet\n\nGroups the 6 alike billing/wallet workflows.\n\n⏸️ **BLOCKED** on payment gateway decision (Moyasar / Tap / HyperPay). Admin-gated via `platform_settings.payments_gateway`.\n\n• **WF 3.1** Payment Success — receipt email + WhatsApp (webhook `/payment`)\n• **WF 3.4** Invoice Generation — HTML→PDF → Supabase Storage (webhook `/invoice-generate`)\n• **WF 3.2** Subscription Renewal Reminder (cron daily 9 AM)\n• **WF 3.3** Credit Expiry Warning (cron daily 9 AM)\n• **Wallet** Balance Sync + low-balance alert (webhook `/wallet-tx`)\n• **Referral** Reward Processing (webhook `/referral-complete`)\n\nEmail templates needed: payment-receipt, subscription-expiring, credit-low. Credentials: Supabase, Resend, Evolution API, Payment Gateway.",
